{"id":"HAD-2078","recordType":"hadith","categoryLabel":"ḤADĪṮ","language":"de","narratorLine":"Abū Hurayrah رضي الله عنه berichtete:","speakerLabel":"Der Prophet ﷺ sagte:","textMarkdown":"Schamhaftigkeit ist ein Zweig des **Īmān**.","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī und Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim","sourceBook":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī / Ṣaḥīḥ Muslim","sourceVolume":null,"sourcePage":null,"sourceChapter":"Kitāb al-Īmān","sourceSection":"Bāb al-Ḥayāʾ min al-Īmān","sourceHadithNumber":null,"sourceEdition":null,"grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"100er-Schritt 2051–2150; mit geprüftem Sharḥ erstellt.","sharhStatus":"verified","sharhText":"Ibn Ḥaǧar erklärt, dass Ḥayāʾ zum Īmān gehört, weil echte Scham den Diener vom Schlechten abhält und ihn zu Gehorsam führt. Darum ist sie nicht bloß Charakter, sondern religiöse Wirkung des Glaubens.","sharhLanguage":"de","sharhScholar":"Ibn Ḥaǧar al-ʿAsqalānī","sharhBook":"Fatḥ al-Bārī","sharhVolume":null,"sharhPage":null,"sharhChapter":"Kitāb al-Īmān","sharhSection":"باب الحياء من الإيمان","sharhEdition":null,"sharhReference":"Fatḥ al-Bārī zu Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī, Kitāb al-Īmān"}